{"title":"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/8/128c474e979661dc51253ccc209a68c052410c1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$202 - 101 + 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"110\" height=\"15\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/4/1246a3391cf7ef0b52dfd5e4d8cb57fd1878343d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 120 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 110 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 111 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 109 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 92$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"470\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66609e06053167d84d07888bdc341fb869315b16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$202 - 101 + 9 = 101 + 9 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 110}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"290\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?t